{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c53b","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0ae11-04bd-7bb0-aac5-3ecca198188f"},"sequence":248,"recorded_at":1780531400000491,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"a44b1373-1c97-4578-936f-97327477c22e","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"a44b1373-1c97-4578-936f-97327477c22e","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"a44b1373-1c97-4578-936f-97327477c22e"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0ae11-a0d8-7cb0-88d5-1fc5cf72f33a"},"task_id":"01a0ae11-a0d8-7cb0-88d5-1fc5cf72f33a","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0ae11-a0d8-7cb0-88d5-1fc5cf72f33a","chunk":"Read text file `/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.task-board/.resources/TASK-260830-3uzfyn/TASK-260830-3uzfyn_results.md`.\n1|# TASK-260830-3uzfyn results — implement profile resolution and persistence\n2|\n3|## Verdict\n4|\n5|**Ready for review.** AC coverage **16 of 16 rows driven** through\n6|the named production entry by the named committed test (matrix:\n7|`TASK-260830-3uzfyn_conformance-matrix.md`). Full suite green (27\n8|packages, `go test ./...`, `-race`, `-cover`), lint/build clean\n9|both platforms, mutant battery 20/20 narrowing kills with the\n10|harmless control survived. Candidate left **uncommitted** in the\n11|Story worktree for the handoff snapshot.\n12|\n13|## What shipped\n14|\n15|New package `internal/sessprofile` (Section 2.4 derivation and\n16|persistence) plus the provhost mapping resolver and launch\n17|projection:\n18|\n19|- `Derive` (session head) and `DeriveForHeads` (checkpoint\n20|  event-head closure) — pure reducer over the validated record and\n21|  the authoritative chain; newest `profile.changed` wins, closure\n22|  events only, continuity re-checked, losing/ambiguous inputs\n23|  refuse. `Projector` binds it to `*sessrepo.Repository` through\n24|  read entries only.\n25|- `MintChangeEvent` — pure `profile.changed` factory computing the\n26|  omit-self digest via `canonicaljson.CalculateObjectIdentity`\n27|  (never `Verify`, so the no-attestation-outside-the-leaf bound\n28|  holds); enforces the vocabulary, from≠to, and the yolo\n29|  confirmation rule.\n30|- `Transactor.SetProfile` — the set-profile transaction: derives\n31|  from, fences the acting lease against the chain head (stale,\n32|  divergent, and greater-epoch acting leases refuse), mints, and\n33|  appends through `sessrepo.AppendEvent`. Retries replay the\n34|  committed change by request envelope\n35|  (target/lease/author/instant).\n36|- Pair projections and checks — `BundlePair`, `ForkProjection`,\n37|  `FinalizePair`, `CheckLaunchPair`, `CheckResumedPair`,\n38|  `CheckForkPair`, `CheckBundlePair`, `CheckResumeRequestProfile`,\n39|  `CheckFinalizeParams`, `CheckBridgeProfile`,\n40|  `ResolveCreationProfile` — the reducer-level pairs the fixtures\n41|  require, each divergence refusing `integrity_failure`.\n42|- `provhost.ResolveMapping` — Section 7.7 mapping against the exact\n43|  probed `BuildTuple` (tuple gate reused, caller argument\n44|  classified first); unmappable provider/version refuses the new\n45|  `profile_mapping_unavailable` Structured Error (exit 6,\n46|  provider/version/profile details); Pi pins 0.73.1 with the\n47|  both-profiles equivalence disclosed.\n48|- `provhost.ProjectLaunchArgv` — sanitized launch argv: the exact\n49|  table flag appended once for yolo (Pi appends nothing, its\n50|  mapping is report-only), base unchanged for standard; duplicate,\n51|  changed, foreign, and standard-mode tokens (including the codex\n52|  alias) refuse; Section 5.1 numeric bounds enforced as the\n53|  host-side twin of the SpawnPlan wire bounds (agreement test at\n54|  every limit).\n55|\n56|Gate updates owned by this change: 12 new derived refusal arms,\n57|all witnessed (floor 217 → 229, constructor list extended to the\n58|seventh constructor); runtime audit extended (seventh wrapper,\n59|closed code set + `profile_mapping_unavailable`); secprim\n60|secret-site census gained the reviewed `unrestrictedTokens`\n61|argv-words row. No traceability row touched (final-leaf owned).\n62|\n63|## Validation observed (this session, real exits)\n64|\n65|- `gofmt -l internal`: clean (433 files), exit 0.\n66|- `go vet ./...` and `GOOS=windows go vet ./...`: exit 0.\n67|- `go build ./...` and `GOOS=windows go build ./...`: exit 0.\n68|- `go test ./... -count=1`: exit 0, 27 ok, 0 fail.\n69|- `go test -race ./... -count=1`: exit 0, 27 ok.\n70|- `go test ./... -cover -count=1`: exit 0\n71|  (`internal/sessprofile` 92.6% of statements).\n72|- Mutant battery `internal/sessprofile/testdata/mutate_profile.py`:\n73|  exit 0; 20/20 applied N plants KILLED, each by its named\n74|  behavioral test; `C-harmless-comment` SURVIVED (applied\n75|  control); `C-not-applied` NOT_APPLIED and `C-compile-failure`\n76|  COMPILE_OR_HARNESS_FAILURE classified outside the numerator;\n77|  control-before/after green; sources restored byte-identical\n78|  (asserted in-harness; digests below).\n79|- Re-ran myself: everything above. Accepted from attached\n80|  evidence: nothing (no prior evidence exists for this task).\n81|\n82|## Specification traceability notes\n83|\n84|- Implemented as the pinned v0.6.0 headings define (§2.4, §7.7,\n85|  with §§5.5/8 as tuple authority); verified by diff that §2.4 and\n86|  §7.7 are textually identical in v0.5.0, so the task's v0.5.0\n87|  scope citation and the producer's v0.6.0 pin agree on this\n88|  deliverable.\n89|- The task text's \"named profiles, CLI overrides, task-board\n90|  profiles\" predate the pin: in v0.6.0 they are the `standard|yolo`\n91|  enum named by `ax start --profile` (creation), `ax session\n92|  set-profile` (change), and the bridge launch/resume profile\n93|  (derived pair). No named registry exists (stated bound B1).\n94|- There is no time-expiring ownership lease in §5.3, so R3/R9\n95|  implement \"losing or expired\" as chain-head mismatch (stale\n96|  epoch, divergent token); see the matrix bounds B1–B8 for the\n97|  full declared list.\n98|\n99|## Files changed (candidate, uncommitted)\n100|\n101|- `internal/sessprofile/`: `doc.go`, `profile.go`, `decode.go`,\n102|  `project.go`, `mint.go`, `setprofile.go`, `pairs.go`, plus\n103|  `fixtures_test.go`, `profile_test.go`, `mint_test.go`,\n104|  `setprofile_test.go`, `pairs_test.go`, `fixtures_e2e_test.go`,\n105|  `crash_test.go`, `testdata/mutate_profile.py`.\n106|- `internal/provhost/profile_resolve.go`,\n107|  `internal/provhost/profile_resolve_test.go`,\n108|  `internal/provhost/refusal_arm_operations_e_test.go`,\n109|  `internal/provhost/protocol.go` (constructor only),\n110|  `internal/provhost/refusal_arm_inventory_test.go` (list, floor,\n111|  aggregation), `internal/provhost/inventory_test.go` (audit).\n112|- `internal/secprim/census_test.go` (one reviewed row).\n113|- `README.md` (package section, no positive claim),\n114|  `LOGBOOK.md` (entry).\n115|\n116|## Evidence attached\n117|\n118|- `TASK-260830-3uzfyn_results.md` (this file).\n119|- `TASK-260830-3uzfyn_conformance-matrix.md` (16/16 + mutant\n120|  census + bounds).\n121|- `TASK-260830-3uzfyn_producer-evidence.tar.gz` (mutant logs +\n122|  `mutants.json`, digests, full/race/cover/lint/build logs).","final_result":true}}}
