holeCodeRegistry\\n=== RUN   TestTheExitStatusAdmissionIsSweptOverEveryByteValue\\n=== PAUSE TestTheExitStatusAdmissionIsSweptOverEveryByteValue\\n=== RUN   TestNewProducesTheNormativeStructuredErrorObject\\n--- PASS: TestNewProducesTheNormativeStructuredErrorObject (0.00s)\\n=== RUN   TestOptionalIdentifiersAreOmittedNotNulled\\n--- PASS: TestOptionalIdentifiersAreOmittedNotNulled (0.00s)\\n=== RUN   TestUnknownDetailKeysNeverChangeAnyMachineAnswer\\n--- PASS: TestUnknownDetailKeysNeverChangeAnyMachineAnswer (0.00s)\\n=== RUN   TestErrorRenderingAndCauseChain\\n--- PASS: TestErrorRenderingAndCauseChain (0.00s)\\n=== RUN   TestBindingForPinsEveryDeclaredContainingContract\\n    binding_test.go:56: static binding coverage: 15/15 pinned containing-contract majors\\n--- PASS: TestBindingForPinsEveryDeclaredContainingContract (0.00s)\\n=== RUN   TestBindingForRefusesUnboundContractMajor\\n--- PASS: TestBindingForRefusesUnboundContractMajor (0.00s)\\n=== RUN   TestDecodeBoundSelectsTheVersionFromTheContainerNotThePayload\\n--- PASS: TestDecodeBoundSelectsTheVersionFromTheContainerNotThePayload (0.00s)\\n=== RUN   TestDecodeRefusesADuplicateMemberOnEveryDeclaredMember\\n=== PAUSE TestDecodeRefusesADuplicateMemberOnEveryDeclaredMember\\n=== RUN   TestADuplicateMemberCannotForgeARetryClaim\\n=== PAUSE TestADuplicateMemberCannotForgeARetryClaim\\n=== RUN   TestADuplicateMemberCannotSplitTheDetailSet\\n=== PAUSE TestADuplicateMemberCannotSplitTheDetailSet\\n=== RUN   TestABoundPeerCannotSendADuplicateKeyedEnvelope\\n=== PAUSE TestABoundPeerCannotSendADuplicateKeyedEnvelope\\n=== RUN   TestADuplicateIdentityMemberIsNotResolvedIntoAVersionFact\\n=== PAUSE TestADuplicateIdentityMemberIsNotResolvedIntoAVersionFact\\n=== RUN   TestTheCanonicalGateDoesNotLaunderTheExitStatusToken\\n=== PAUSE TestTheCanonicalGateDoesNotLaunderTheExitStatusToken\\n=== RUN   TestTheCommonDataModelGateCoversMoreThanDuplicates\\n=== PAUSE TestTheCommonDataModelGateCoversMoreThanDuplicates\\n=== RUN   Te